WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.236 --> 00:00:02.890
- I truly am a lightweight,
but like, what?

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:04.928
I had three scoops of ice cream!

00:00:04.928 --> 00:00:08.174
(rhythmic rock music)

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.007
- I'm Chelsea.

00:00:09.007 --> 00:00:10.921
I'm a video producer in
New York, and I'm on my way

00:00:10.921 --> 00:00:13.452
to Tipsy Scoop, a place
that combines both ice cream

00:00:13.452 --> 00:00:16.350
and alcohol, two of my favorite things.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.517
(rhythmic rock music)

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:29.976
- Just tried a bunch of the flavors.

00:00:29.976 --> 00:00:32.682
They were all delicious, and
now I'm gonna bring them back

00:00:32.682 --> 00:00:33.747
and see what my coworkers think.

00:00:33.747 --> 00:00:35.757
- Drinks, alcohol, and
then, like, had ice cream.

00:00:35.757 --> 00:00:37.269
But I've never, like, combined it.

00:00:37.269 --> 00:00:39.923
- We're hoping that we can find
a really good intersection.

00:00:39.923 --> 00:00:40.756
- Yeah.

00:00:40.756 --> 00:00:42.334
- I love ice cream, and I love booze,

00:00:42.334 --> 00:00:43.813
so I definitely wanna try it.

00:00:43.813 --> 00:00:45.783
(rock music continues)

00:00:45.783 --> 00:00:48.566
- I wish I could swirl
this like it was alcohol.

00:00:48.566 --> 00:00:50.638
- It kinda looks like a Frosty.

00:00:50.638 --> 00:00:52.294
- Chocolate whiskey?

00:00:52.294 --> 00:00:53.768
I like both of those things.

00:00:53.768 --> 00:00:54.601
- Okay.

00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:55.717
- I don't really, I don't like whiskey.

00:00:55.717 --> 00:00:56.550
But this tastes really good.

00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:58.123
- I think chocolate and
whiskey is a good combination.

00:00:58.123 --> 00:00:59.930
I never thought about
combining the two before.

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:01.815
- It's really good, it tastes
like that bourbon flavor

00:01:01.815 --> 00:01:04.165
you get in a food that's
made with dark liquors.

00:01:04.165 --> 00:01:07.439
- It's not super overpowering,
I guess, which is good.

00:01:07.439 --> 00:01:08.546
- I also don't really believe you

00:01:08.546 --> 00:01:09.879
that there's alcohol in these.

00:01:09.879 --> 00:01:11.031
- This would be funny in, like,

00:01:11.031 --> 00:01:13.162
an ice cream cake at a birthday party.

00:01:13.162 --> 00:01:15.695
- Turn up at the playground.

00:01:15.695 --> 00:01:19.406
(cheery electronic music)

00:01:19.406 --> 00:01:21.293
- So this definitely gives me more

00:01:21.293 --> 00:01:23.648
of a coffee cream kinda look.

00:01:23.648 --> 00:01:25.286
- This is good.

00:01:25.286 --> 00:01:26.622
- It almost tastes like
a coffee-like martini.

00:01:26.622 --> 00:01:28.962
- It tastes like a frozen white Russian.

00:01:28.962 --> 00:01:30.385
- Irish cream...

00:01:30.385 --> 00:01:31.218
Eh?

00:01:31.218 --> 00:01:32.841
That was an Irish-like sound effect.

00:01:32.841 --> 00:01:34.908
- It doesn't look like
it's gonna be strong.

00:01:34.908 --> 00:01:36.065
- Yeah, it's like vanilla ice cream

00:01:36.065 --> 00:01:37.708
that will also get me fucked up.

00:01:37.708 --> 00:01:39.912
- There's like a hazelnut
or something in here?

00:01:39.912 --> 00:01:42.554
That definitely kinda helps like cope

00:01:42.554 --> 00:01:44.620
with the coffee bean flavor.

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:45.694
- I wouldn't order a Kahlua drink,

00:01:45.694 --> 00:01:47.458
but, like, I would buy this.

00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:50.034
- Our judgment is gonna get slowly skewed.

00:01:50.034 --> 00:01:52.036
(island music)

00:01:52.036 --> 00:01:54.793
- Really fucking excited
about this mango margarita.

00:01:54.793 --> 00:01:55.880
- Are you a tequila person?

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:56.713
- I absolutely am.

00:01:56.713 --> 00:01:57.546
- Hell yeah.

00:01:57.546 --> 00:01:58.730
- This is better than a
lot of frozen margaritas

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:00.056
I've had in, like, bars.

00:02:00.056 --> 00:02:00.889
- That's good.

00:02:00.889 --> 00:02:01.722
- Yeah.

00:02:01.722 --> 00:02:02.897
- That's really goddamn good.

00:02:02.897 --> 00:02:04.426
- I don't like tequila at all.

00:02:04.426 --> 00:02:05.645
(laughs) That was strong.

00:02:05.645 --> 00:02:08.626
- Yeah, I think that one
tastes the most like alcohol.

00:02:08.626 --> 00:02:10.900
- It tastes kind of like
an orange creamsicle.

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.680
- Good balance of mango
and tequila, for sure.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:15.536
- I think we both liked that one.

00:02:15.536 --> 00:02:17.144
- Yeah, a little too much. (laughs)

00:02:17.144 --> 00:02:19.080
(upbeat dance music)

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:20.268
- This is actually delicious.

00:02:20.268 --> 00:02:21.155
- This is really good.

00:02:21.155 --> 00:02:24.326
- It's good but I don't
think I want a lot of it.

00:02:24.326 --> 00:02:25.159
- Yeah

00:02:25.159 --> 00:02:26.326
- This doesn't taste like alcohol at all.

00:02:26.326 --> 00:02:29.589
- Like those Italian icee's,
but like an adult Italian icee.

00:02:29.589 --> 00:02:30.824
- I'm gonna finish this.

00:02:30.824 --> 00:02:31.657
(laughs)

00:02:31.657 --> 00:02:32.828
This was really good.

00:02:32.828 --> 00:02:35.578
(dramatic music)

00:02:36.724 --> 00:02:39.807
(people blowing air)

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:43.511
- 0.0

00:02:43.511 --> 00:02:46.293
- I got .03, I can drive home.

00:02:46.293 --> 00:02:47.554
- I got .05.

00:02:47.554 --> 00:02:48.895
- 0.0.

00:02:48.895 --> 00:02:50.395
- I got 0.0000000.

00:02:52.182 --> 00:02:53.015
- .07.

00:02:53.015 --> 00:02:53.930
(laughs)

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:54.946
That's insane.

00:02:54.946 --> 00:02:56.369
- Ah man, I love this!

00:02:56.369 --> 00:02:58.968
- This is not a choice,
we were forced to do this.

00:02:58.968 --> 00:03:01.520
- I just wish maybe it was
a little more heavy handed,

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:02.849
maybe there's a little
more bang for your buck.

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:05.258
- Maybe with a shot or
more alcohol on top.

00:03:05.258 --> 00:03:06.782
- I for sure would like eat,

00:03:06.782 --> 00:03:08.420
whenever the hell I wanted to get drunk,

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:10.657
not wanting people to know
that I was getting drunk.

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:12.131
- I would say these were really good,

00:03:12.131 --> 00:03:14.668
just tasted like ice cream,
that also gets you wasted.

00:03:14.668 --> 00:03:16.133
- "You had anything to drink today?"

00:03:16.133 --> 00:03:18.941
Well, I had a lot of ice cream, officer.

00:03:18.941 --> 00:03:21.524
(upbeat music)

00:03:23.675 --> 00:03:25.993
(woosh sound)

00:03:25.993 --> 00:03:28.660
(upbeat music)

